"text": "It all boils down to this: drainage is the most crucial design decision for any trail.",
"char_start": 5071,
"char_end": 5157,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 242.23,
"end": 243.69,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox components.",
"char_start": 5158,
"char_end": 5214,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 243.69,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 5215,
"char_end": 5304,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s03"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 248.27,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5317,
"char_end": 5354,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 248.27,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
